    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but connection is just another temporary thing that's gonna disappear anyway. it's like building a sandcastle right before a massive tide comes in. it doesn't feel \"deep,\" it just feels exhausting to keep trying when you know the outcome is always just emptiness. i'm just so tired of the struggle.",
